# Balboa Remade - an island of the library's plan Raft Remade (in place of Raft's Balboa)
# Raft's Balboa made anew: a jungle mountain remade from Balboa's own, the rangers' station on its beach, their radio mast on the summit, a bear's cave in its flank. Quest "The Rangers' Mast".
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe balboa_remade) through the editor's own operations.
new
# (nature and the life under water: as on Raft's island itself - Randomize existing measures them)
gen Friendly=0.2 SeaLife=0.3
randomize BalboaIsland Seed=7103 Radius=120 Height=55 Hostiles=0
